    "description": "13-Pc Vintage Standard Brand Electronic Tubes 5961 7044 12AX7 1216 Lot\nThis lot includes 13 vintage Standard Brand electronic tubes, also known as vacuum tubes, of various models and sizes. The tubes feature types such as 5961, 7044, 12AX7, and 1216, with handwritten labels indicating testing and manufacturing details. Each tube is housed in its original branded box with a red and black color scheme. The tubes are made of glass with metal pin connectors. Items are untested. Suitable for collectors, vintage electronics enthusiasts, or restoration of classic audio and radio equipment.\nDetails\nAttribute\nValue\nBrand:\nStandard\nCompatible Brand:\nUniversal\nType:\nTubes\nThis is a pre-owned, donated item being sold “AS IS.\nItems may show wear consistent with usage and age, such as: discoloration; scratches; scuffs; dents; cracks; chips; holes; loose threads and stitches; edge and corner wear; box wear; oxidation; dirt; dust; other residue; owner-added markings; and signs of repair such as tape and glue.\nLot items may not contain all original parts or accessories and may have been outfitted with replacement pieces and/or modifications by previous owners\nBulk lots are not returnable. Due to the volume of items that flow through our eCommerce department, customer service requests to test items may be denied.\nAny certificates and markers of authenticity referenced in this listing are assertions of authenticity by the manufacturer, production company, or a third party, and not a guarantee of authenticity by Goodwill.\nItems and autographs without certificates or markers of authenticity cannot be guaranteed authentic -- while we do our best to identify and discard fakes, we are not experts.\nUnless noted, collectibles such as coins, comics, and trading cards are ungraded. Coin lots may or may not contain currency in circulation. Lots may also contain dead currency, reproductions, replicas, commemorative tokens, admission tokens, medals, and/or other non-monetary coins.\nAny items used for safety should be inspected by a professional before usage. All collectibles are intended for display only and using any purchased goods for dangerous or illegal activity is strictly prohibited.\nWe are not expert evaluators. Please ask all questions and review all photos prior to bidding.\nPhotos are part of item descriptions.\nUnless stated all merchandise is untested and sold as is. We are not expert evaluators.\nPlease ask all questions and review all photos prior to bidding.\nWe try our best to check for defects or excessive wear but sometimes we fail to catch defects.\n***With this in mind, we are selling item/items \"as is\".",
